#27607
Mountain road~
   The road follows the base of the mountain almost like it was built just for
the mountain itself.  The mountain itself seems odd in that it seems smaller
around the base than at the top.  The forest makes a perfect wall so that
nothing can get through into the forest or even come out of the forest onto the
road.  The road forks to the north and continues west and back to the east.  
The trail to the gnome camp is north.    
