#27623
Trail to gnome camp~
   The gnomes were the second of the races to reach the mountain and since the
humans had the right side of the front side of the mountain they figured this
was as good as any.  The gnomes have a very unique cable and pulley system for
getting supplies and even sometimes soldiers up the side of the mountain.  The
path towards the gnome camp heads up with trails back to the main rode south
and west .
