#27624
Trail of the gnomes.~
   The gnomes using logic only a gnome could understand picked this side of the
mountain because the trees had nice shade to rest under as they climbed the
mountain.  The trail actually isn't that hard of a climb and the top does not
seem that far away.  The rain drains on the other side of the mountain so the
trail is not rutted out like others are.    
~
