world, now it is the ultimate prize in the war for supposed immortality.  The
eventual victor will never be blessed with immortality, for the fallen angel
had come to this mountain to warn the world of an impending chaos.  The forces
of chaos could never enter the world unless there was a monumental amount of
deaths and hatred to open the gateway for the chaos hordes to enter.  Now the
time is almost right for master of chaos and his hordes to enter the world.  

