fallen angel both revered the young boy but also were callous.  For an angel to
fall from the heavens they knew that the angel had to encoured the wrath of the
gods.  For a young boy to meet a fallen angel then he must either be blessed by
the gods or cursed by the gods for his act of so called bravery.  The fallen
angel had indeed incurred the wrath of the gods, but it was her choice to give
